OL,3,GNEWSADoctor wins award for neonatal
OL,4,Ajaundice programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS consultant has won a national
OL,7,Faward for her work improving the
OL,8,Frecognition, assessment and care of
OL,9,Fneonatal jaundice in babies with darker
OL,10,Fskin tones.
OL,12,FDr Helen Gbinigie, who works at Medway
OL,13,FMaritime Hospital in Gillingham, Kent,
OL,14,Fhas been named inclusive leader of the
OL,15,Fyear at the BAME Health and Care
OL,16,FAwards.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
