OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADoctor wins award for neonatal
OL,4,Ajaundice programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was nominated for her Jaundice in
OL,7,FDarker Skin Tone Babies Programme,
OL,8,Fwhich "tackles inequalities in the care
OL,9,Fof babies with neonatal jaundice and
OL,10,Fhelps ensure fairer care for all
OL,11,Fnewborns", the hospital said.
OL,13,FGbinigie said: "Creating long-term
OL,14,Fchange requires joint working,
OL,15,Fcompassion and a shared commitment to
OL,16,Fequity."
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
